### Finally 
These are some extra questions you could have a think about, as they are open ended there aren't solutions to this part.

Look at the confidence intervals you have produced, how do they relate to the tests you have performed.

Pick another combination of lecturers and perform a hypothesis test to compare the difference in guess for these, perhaps try a one sided test this time, choose the test you believe is better for the situation.  

